```mermaid
flowchart TD
    START[Agent Work Complete] --> GATE_CHECK{HITL Gate Required?}

    GATE_CHECK -->|No| CONTINUE[Continue to Next Agent]
    GATE_CHECK -->|Yes| GATE_TYPE{Which Gate Type?}

    %% Gate Types
    GATE_TYPE --> ARCH_START[🏗️ Architecture Start]
    GATE_TYPE --> ARCH_LOCK[🔒 Architecture Lock]
    GATE_TYPE --> GREEN_LIGHT[🚦 Green Light]
    GATE_TYPE --> DEV_COMPLETE[💻 Development Complete]
    GATE_TYPE --> REL_READY[📦 Release Ready]
    GATE_TYPE --> STAGING_OK[🧪 Staging Verified]
    GATE_TYPE --> PROD_READY[🚀 Production Ready]
    GATE_TYPE --> LAUNCH[🌐 Launch]

    %% Architecture Start Gate
    ARCH_START --> ARCH_START_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Project scope<br/>• Resource requirements<br/>• Timeline estimate]
    ARCH_START_PRESENT --> ARCH_START_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve architecture-start]
    ARCH_START_WAIT --> ARCH_START_DECISION{User Decision}
    ARCH_START_DECISION -->|Approve| ARCH_START_APPROVED[Begin Solution Architect]
    ARCH_START_DECISION -->|Reject| ARCH_START_REJECTED[Return to ideation]

    %% Architecture Lock Gate
    ARCH_LOCK --> ARCH_LOCK_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Technology stack<br/>• Architecture decisions<br/>• Success probability]
    ARCH_LOCK_PRESENT --> ARCH_LOCK_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve architecture-lock]
    ARCH_LOCK_WAIT --> ARCH_LOCK_DECISION{User Decision}
    ARCH_LOCK_DECISION -->|Approve| ARCH_LOCK_APPROVED[Lock decisions, proceed to Product]
    ARCH_LOCK_DECISION -->|Reject| ARCH_LOCK_REJECTED[Return to Solution Architect]

    %% Green Light Gate
    GREEN_LIGHT --> GREEN_LIGHT_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• MVP definition<br/>• User stories<br/>• Business case<br/>• Implementation roadmap]
    GREEN_LIGHT_PRESENT --> GREEN_LIGHT_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve green-light]
    GREEN_LIGHT_WAIT --> GREEN_LIGHT_DECISION{User Decision}
    GREEN_LIGHT_DECISION -->|Approve| GREEN_LIGHT_APPROVED[Begin Development Phase]
    GREEN_LIGHT_DECISION -->|Reject| GREEN_LIGHT_REJECTED[Return to Product refinement]

    %% Development Complete Gate
    DEV_COMPLETE --> DEV_COMPLETE_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Implementation complete<br/>• Test results<br/>• Quality metrics<br/>• Performance benchmarks]
    DEV_COMPLETE_PRESENT --> DEV_COMPLETE_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve development]
    DEV_COMPLETE_WAIT --> DEV_COMPLETE_DECISION{User Decision}
    DEV_COMPLETE_DECISION -->|Approve| DEV_COMPLETE_APPROVED[Begin Release preparation]
    DEV_COMPLETE_DECISION -->|Reject| DEV_COMPLETE_REJECTED[Return to Development fixes]

    %% Release Ready Gate
    REL_READY --> REL_READY_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Documentation complete<br/>• Security scans passed<br/>• Release artifacts ready<br/>• Infrastructure code generated]
    REL_READY_PRESENT --> REL_READY_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve release]
    REL_READY_WAIT --> REL_READY_DECISION{User Decision}
    REL_READY_DECISION -->|Approve| REL_READY_APPROVED[Deploy to staging]
    REL_READY_DECISION -->|Reject| REL_READY_REJECTED[Return to Release refinement]

    %% Staging Verified Gate
    STAGING_OK --> STAGING_OK_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Staging deployment successful<br/>• Integration tests passed<br/>• Performance verified<br/>• Ready for production]
    STAGING_OK_PRESENT --> STAGING_OK_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve staging]
    STAGING_OK_WAIT --> STAGING_OK_DECISION{User Decision}
    STAGING_OK_DECISION -->|Approve| STAGING_OK_APPROVED[Deploy to production]
    STAGING_OK_DECISION -->|Reject| STAGING_OK_REJECTED[Return to staging fixes]

    %% Production Ready Gate
    PROD_READY --> PROD_READY_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• Production deployment successful<br/>• Health checks passing<br/>• Monitoring active<br/>• Ready for traffic]
    PROD_READY_PRESENT --> PROD_READY_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve production]
    PROD_READY_WAIT --> PROD_READY_DECISION{User Decision}
    PROD_READY_DECISION -->|Approve| PROD_READY_APPROVED[Enable production access]
    PROD_READY_DECISION -->|Reject| PROD_READY_REJECTED[Return to production fixes]

    %% Launch Gate
    LAUNCH --> LAUNCH_PRESENT[Present to User:<br/>• System fully operational<br/>• Users can access<br/>• Analytics tracking<br/>• Support processes active]
    LAUNCH_PRESENT --> LAUNCH_WAIT[Wait for /ts-approve launch]
    LAUNCH_WAIT --> LAUNCH_DECISION{User Decision}
    LAUNCH_DECISION -->|Approve| LAUNCH_APPROVED[🎉 Project successfully launched]
    LAUNCH_DECISION -->|Reject| LAUNCH_REJECTED[Return to pre-launch preparation]

    %% Common flows
    ARCH_START_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    ARCH_LOCK_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    GREEN_LIGHT_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    DEV_COMPLETE_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    REL_READY_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    STAGING_OK_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    PROD_READY_APPROVED --> CONTINUE
    LAUNCH_APPROVED --> PROJECT_COMPLETE[🎯 Project Complete]

    %% Rejection flows - return to previous agent
    ARCH_START_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE[Restart current phase]
    ARCH_LOCK_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    GREEN_LIGHT_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    DEV_COMPLETE_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    REL_READY_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    STAGING_OK_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    PROD_READY_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE
    LAUNCH_REJECTED --> RESTART_PHASE

    %% Turbo mode bypass
    GATE_CHECK -->|Turbo Mode| TURBO_BYPASS[Skip all gates<br/>Autonomous execution]
    TURBO_BYPASS --> CONTINUE

    %% Emergency stops
    ARCH_LOCK_DECISION -->|Critical Security Issue| EMERGENCY_STOP[🛑 Emergency Stop]
    GREEN_LIGHT_DECISION -->|Critical Security Issue| EMERGENCY_STOP
    DEV_COMPLETE_DECISION -->|Critical Security Issue| EMERGENCY_STOP
    REL_READY_DECISION -->|Critical Security Issue| EMERGENCY_STOP

    EMERGENCY_STOP --> SECURITY_REVIEW[Security Engineer Review]
    SECURITY_REVIEW --> SECURITY_FIX[Fix security issues]
    SECURITY_FIX --> RESTART_PHASE

    %% Style classes
    classDef gate fill:#FFE4E1,stroke:#DC143C,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#E6F3FF,stroke:#4169E1,stroke-width:2px
    classDef approve fill:#F0FFF0,stroke:#32CD32,stroke-width:2px
    classDef reject fill:#FFE4B5,stroke:#D2691E,stroke-width:2px
    classDef emergency fill:#FF6B6B,stroke:#CC0000,stroke-width:3px

    class ARCH_START,ARCH_LOCK,GREEN_LIGHT,DEV_COMPLETE,REL_READY,STAGING_OK,PROD_READY,LAUNCH gate
    class ARCH_START_DECISION,ARCH_LOCK_DECISION,GREEN_LIGHT_DECISION,DEV_COMPLETE_DECISION,REL_READY_DECISION,STAGING_OK_DECISION,PROD_READY_DECISION,LAUNCH_DECISION decision
    class ARCH_START_APPROVED,ARCH_LOCK_APPROVED,GREEN_LIGHT_APPROVED,DEV_COMPLETE_APPROVED,REL_READY_APPROVED,STAGING_OK_APPROVED,PROD_READY_APPROVED,LAUNCH_APPROVED approve
    class ARCH_START_REJECTED,ARCH_LOCK_REJECTED,GREEN_LIGHT_REJECTED,DEV_COMPLETE_REJECTED,REL_READY_REJECTED,STAGING_OK_REJECTED,PROD_READY_REJECTED,LAUNCH_REJECTED reject
    class EMERGENCY_STOP,SECURITY_REVIEW emergency
```